### Throttling API Requests

Limit the frequency of API calls to prevent overwhelming the server:

```javascript
let isFetching = false;

async function fetchCityData(input) {
  if (isFetching) return;
  isFetching = true;

  try {
    const cachedResult = cache.get(input);
